cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GRAIN — Geodynamics Research Analogue Information Network"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  GRAIN is a MATLAB toolset that turns analogue (sandbox) tectonic experiments into
  quantitative, reproducible kinematic data. It wraps PIVlab in a batch pipeline
  running from time-lapse photographs to fault-by-fault measurements: velocity
  magnitude and shear-strain fields, plot-over-time curves, hanging-wall/footwall
  velocities, net slip, fault geometry, and a frame-by-frame description table.
